mplifies transmitted signals","synset":"oewn-04050813-n"},"rain":{"definition":"water falling in drops from vapor condensed in the atmosphere","synset":"oewn-11521799-n"},"restaurant":{"definition":"a building where people go to eat","synset":"oewn-04088393-n"},"ring":{"definition":"jewelry consisting of a circlet of precious metal (often set with jewels) worn on the finger","synset":"oewn-04099721-n"},"road":{"definition":"an open way (generally public) for travel or transportation","synset":"oewn-04103160-n"},"robin":{"definition":"small Old World songbird with a reddish breast","synset":"oewn-01564906-n"},"ruby":{"definition":"a transparent piece of ruby that has been cut and polished and is valued as a precious gem","synset":"oewn-13393435-n"},"sailor":{"definition":"any member of a ship's crew","synset":"oewn-10566190-n"},"scarf":{"definition":"a garment worn around the head or neck or shoulders for warmth or decoration","synset":"oewn-04150962-n"},"shark":{"definition":"any of numerous elongate mostly marine carnivorous fishes with heterocercal caudal fins and tough skin covered with small toothlike scales","synset":"oewn-01484971-n"},"shoe":{"definition":"footwear shaped to fit the foot (below the ankle) with a flexible upper of leather or plastic and a sole and heel of heavier material","synset":"oewn-04206070-n"},"sister":{"definition":"a female person who has the same parents as another person","synset":"oewn-10622393-n"},"skeleton":{"definition":"the hard structure (bones and cartilages) that provides a frame for the body of an animal","synset":"oewn-05593033-n"},"snake":{"definition":"limbless scaly elongate reptile; some are venomous","synset":"oewn-01729333-n"},"soap":{"definition":"a cleansing agent made from the salts of vegetable or animal fats","synset":"oewn-04260547-n"},"spider":{"definition":"predatory arachnid with eight legs, two poison fangs, two feelers, and usually two silk-spinning organs at the back end of the body; they spin silk to make