nd","synset":"oewn-11539883-n"},"tractor":{"definition":"a wheeled vehicle with large wheels; used in farming and other applications","synset":"oewn-04472736-n"},"traffic":{"definition":"the aggregation of things (pedestrians or vehicles) coming and going in a particular locality during a specified period of time","synset":"oewn-08442260-n"},"trumpet":{"definition":"a brass musical instrument with a brilliant tone; has a narrow tube and a flared bell and is played by means of valves","synset":"oewn-03115320-n"},"turtle":{"definition":"any of various aquatic and land reptiles having a bony shell and flipper-like limbs for swimming","synset":"oewn-01665425-n"},"unicorn":{"definition":"an imaginary creature represented as a white horse with a long horn growing from its forehead","synset":"oewn-10757621-n"},"violin":{"definition":"bowed stringed instrument that is the highest member of the violin family; this instrument has four strings and a hollow body and an unfretted fingerboard and is played with a bow","synset":"oewn-04544161-n"},"wallet":{"definition":"a pocket-size case for holding papers and paper money","synset":"oewn-04555648-n"},"whale":{"definition":"any of the larger cetacean mammals having a streamlined body and breathing through a blowhole on the head","synset":"oewn-02065397-n"},"windmill":{"definition":"a mill that is powered by the wind","synset":"oewn-04594862-n"},"wolf":{"definition":"any of various predatory carnivorous canine mammals of North America and Eurasia that usually hunt in packs","synset":"oewn-02116752-n"},"zebra":{"definition":"any of several fleet black-and-white striped African equines","synset":"oewn-02393701-n"}},"targetContexts":{"airport":"airport: an airfield equipped with control tower and hangars as well as accommodations for passengers and cargo","anchor":"anchor: a mechanical device that prevents a vessel from moving","apple":"apple: fruit with red or yellow or green skin and sweet to tart crisp whitish flesh","avalanche":"a